{"strongs": "H0450", "word": "אֶלְיָדָע", "translit": "el.ya.da", "root": "אלידע", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "God knows", "definition": "אֶלְיָדָע proper name, masculine ( God knows , compare דְּעוּאֵל , Sabean אלידע Hal 209 ) \\ \\ a. son of David 2Sam 5:16 ; 1Chr 3:8 = בעלידע 1Chr 14:7 which perhaps read here, compare Dr Sm. \\ \\ b. father of an adversary of Solomon 1Kgs 11:23 = \\ \\ c. chief of Benjamin 2Chr 17:17 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB438')\">BDB438</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H450')\">H450</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB437')\">BDB437</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB439')\">BDB439</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֶלְיָדָע</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>God knows</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>דְּעוּאֵל</bdbheb>, Sabean <bdbheb>אלידע</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>209</sup></lookup>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> son of David <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,16)\">2Sam 5:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,8)\">1Chr 3:8</ref> = <bdbheb>בעלידע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 14:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,14,7)\">1Chr 14:7</ref> which perhaps read here, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>Sm.</sup></lookup> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> father of an adversary of Solomon <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:23\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,23)\">1Kgs 11:23</ref> = <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> chief of Benjamin <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,17)\">2Chr 17:17</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 5:16", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "1Chr 3:8", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 3, "ve